//     (0.19215687, 0.3019608, 0.4745098) = (49, 77, 121) as bytes = #314D79.
//     The scene file stores it as a Color — four floats — which is the same
//     colour in the other struct, and why the Inspector offers you both.
//   * There is NO shockwave prefab anywhere in this project, and 8.4's own
//     header says so (attacks are prefabs the student builds). The old Step 3
//     sent the student to "your shockwave prefab", which does not exist; it now
