//     asked what happened to the 300 as though it were clamped or wrapped.
//
// SHAPE: this is a `concept` lesson, so it carries the three recurring
// questions with frame: 'concept' (src/lib/walkthrough.ts) and renders NO
// walkthrough — Unit 9 has no code in it, so the code-scaffolding vocabulary
// would be a claim about a file this lesson does not have. Level 3 both ways:
