    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-09/binary-and-hex.html">Binary &amp; Hex</a> — hex tables and practice</li>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-09/index.html">Unit 9: Data &amp; Systems</a> — where this unit goes</li>
